            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

      <div style="margin-top:18px" class="spec">
        <h4 style="margin:0 0 8px 0">A brief note on scope</h4>
        <p class="muted" style="margin:0">I provide outpatient psychotherapy and coaching-style clinical work. I do not provide emergency care. If you are in crisis, please call emergency services or a local crisis line.</p>
      </div>

      <div style="margin-top:18px" class="spec">
        <h4 style="margin:0 0 8px 0">Client voices</h4>
        <div class="quote">"Practical and calm — we set a clear aim each time and measured progress in ways that mattered to me." — a client</div>
